I've played a number of Slashem games, and drain resistance is just
not that critical.  The number of wands of draining in the game is not
that great, and you can regain lost levels by drinking full-healing.
Also, you can just carry Excalibur/Stormy in your main inventory and
wield it in one turn whenever one of those come on screen.

...alternatively, go without reflection.  My first ascention in
Slashem was reflectionless.  You gotta be a little careful what you
carry in your main invertory (and you can always keep Nighthorn around
in case), but it's totally doable.

Or - play a vampire - you get both drain resistance and flying.  I
believe playing necromancer/undead slayer gives you drain-resist as
